The core idiom we are trying to detect is: if(x0==0)
gotoloop-exit//thepreconditionoftheloop
cnt0=init-val;
do{
x=phi(x0,x.next);//PhiX
cnt=phi(cnt0,cnt.next);

cnt.next=cnt+1;
...
